{"hw":"δαιμονάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δαιμονάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δαιμονάω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be under the power of a</b> <span class=\"gk\">δαίμων,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to suffer by a divine visitation,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δαιμονᾷ δόμος κακοῖς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">566</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δαιμονῶντες ἐν ἄτᾳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1008</span> </span> (lyr.): abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be possessed, to be mad,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">888</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.1.9</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Marc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">δαιμονᾷς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">140</span> </span>.</div></div>"}